    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Balenciaga's Fall 26 collection introduces the Le City Sleek Box handbag, reimagining the classic motorcycle bag in a boxy silhouette. Crafted from glossy black calfskin leather, its clean lines and sharp angles are accentuated by a flap closure, giving the bag a more structured presence. The design retains signature details like antiqued silver studs and leather fringe, paired with a hand-braided top handle and a removable, adjustable shoulder strap, striking a balance between elegance and edgy cool.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
